"story": ["2189. The deep-space array at the edge of the Kuiper Belt went silent nineteen minutes ago. Its last transmission showed a single image: a wall of bio-mechanical ships, swarming like insects, pouring out of a tear in space.", "Earth's fleet is still three days out. The only thing between the swarm and the inner colonies is the Thunder-class interceptor on patrol in this sector. That's you.", "Command's orders are simple: hold the line. Scout drones will come first, then their guardians and hunters. Long-range scans picked up two massive signatures behind the swarm - a carrier-class Hive Beetle and something even bigger, burrowing through the debris field.", "Bring them down, pilot. Show them that this system bites back."],
"swarm_base": 15,
